name=Furnish by Room
id=FurnishByRoom
description=A cheat for decorating. Press F7 (or right-click a room and choose Furnish this kitchen...) to pick a room type, then place its furniture and floors for free: kitchen appliances, counters and tile floors; beds, dressers and nightstands; couches, TVs and bookshelves; dining sets; bar stools and counters; workbenches and garage storage. Rotate with R, undo with Ctrl+Z. Choose between a catalog window and a bottom strip in Options > Mods. Single player.
